00:23:32.660 --> 00:23:39.630
measure how well model generalizes in using
the training set, and it divides it into even

00:23:39.630 --> 00:23:43.980
smaller training sets to
gauge how the model performs on data it hasn't

00:23:43.980 --> 00:23:44.980
seen before.

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:49.039
So for example, if we had five samples-- we
can call

00:23:49.039 --> 00:23:57.559
