tree.

00:24:22.340 --> 00:24:27.490
So just like a normal tree, sometimes these
types of trees need paring back.

00:24:27.490 --> 00:24:30.230
They need to be told, don't be
so specific.

00:24:30.230 --> 00:24:31.850
You need to be more general.

00:24:31.850 --> 00:24:36.970
That way I can go ahead and-- when I get new
