00:53:06.000 --> 00:53:09.590
So Someone is asking, do you have any resources
on choosing the

00:53:09.590 --> 00:53:14.040
right machine learning model for your particular
question?

00:53:14.040 --> 00:53:18.980
Yeah, and this is where it gets that data
art piece as well.

00:53:18.980 --> 00:53:21.980
So we have technologies that do automatic
modeling.

00:53:21.980 --> 00:53:24.000
I
showed you one of them today.

00:53:24.000 --> 00:53:26.780
We call that IBM machine learning.

00:53:26.780 --> 00:53:35.700
And what that does is it separates out the
obvious technologies-- or, sorry, obvious

00:53:35.700 --> 00:53:38.530
algorithms or models for a problem, if some
just aren't appropriate for

00:53:38.530 --> 00:53:40.100
certain things.

00:53:40.100 --> 00:53:43.520
And then it will go through and do subtle
testing.

00:53:43.520 --> 00:53:46.580
We call it cognitive assistance for data science.

00:53:46.580 --> 00:53:50.630
So there are other technology platforms out
there that do that.

00:53:50.630 --> 00:53:58.330
If you want to do it the old fashioned way,
unfortunately, it's sort of an understanding

00:53:58.330 --> 00:54:00.660
of the models, and this is where the art comes
in.

00:54:00.660 --> 00:54:03.800
So you may
understand that Random Forest works really

00:54:03.800 --> 00:54:09.950
great for certain problems, but you've got
more ability to tweak

00:54:09.950 --> 00:54:10.950
algorithms or things there.

00:54:10.950 --> 00:54:14.550
So a lot of it's going to be personal experience,
unfortunately.

00:54:14.550 --> 00:54:17.510
But we do have
technologies like Watson Analytics and Watson

00:54:17.510 --> 00:54:21.510
Machine Learning that will go through, test
a bunch of model, and

00:54:21.510 --> 00:54:24.090
then give you what it thinks is the strongest
solution.

00:54:24.090 --> 00:54:27.190
So that's technology that's been out for a
while.

00:54:27.190 --> 00:54:30.560
But again, a
lot of it can be just based on personal experience,

00:54:30.560 --> 00:54:31.560
unfortunately.

00:54:31.560 --> 00:54:32.560
Right.

00:54:32.560 --> 00:54:37.471
